5,1,1,talk,Asuka,,The morning rush is becoming a physical struggle. I need to understand the flow.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Ryuji,,I am concerned about the financial implications of any new system.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,George,,"I suspect the current allocation is unfair, but I need proof.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Shunichi,,I worry about social friction. We need to avoid conflict.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Mio,,Who is actually going to maintain this? I need to know the workload.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Asuka,,"@Ryuji, if we charge for spaces, does that solve the crowding?","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Ryuji,,"@Asuka, only if the income covers the maintenance costs.","{""words"":9,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,George,,"@Shunichi, I agree. Friction is the biggest risk here.","{""words"":9,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Shunichi,,"@George, yes. We need a system that feels neutral.","{""words"":9,""mentions"":[""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Mio,,"@Ryuji, I am worried about the administrative burden on the treasurer.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Asuka,,I will look at the morning departures to see the peak times.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Ryuji,,I will check the building account's two-year ledger for costs.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,George,,I will review the five years of association minutes.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Shunichi,,I will read the last year's complaint log entries.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Mio,,I will examine the treasurer's handover file on cash collections.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,Asuka,,I will also check the rain exposure along the parking rows.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,1,4,talk,Ryuji,,I will also look at the ward cycle park by the station.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,1,4,talk,George,,I will also check the sticker register and the daily riders.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
23,1,4,talk,Shunichi,,I will also read the account from the neighbouring block's secretary.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
24,1,4,talk,Mio,,I will also test the trial of the supplier's display frame.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
