35,2,1,talk,Asuka,,"Eleven bikes leave between seven and nine. Four times, someone had to shift another.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,Ryuji,,"The ledger shows little capital work. The ward park costs 2,600 yen monthly.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,George,,The minutes show the same flats held covered spots for years. No review.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,Shunichi,,The complaint log has nine notes about leaning bikes. All died out.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Mio,,The handover file logs three hours a month for cash reconciliation.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,Asuka,,"@Ryuji, 2,600 yen is high. Can we afford to charge that?","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,Ryuji,,"@Asuka, the ledger is thin. We would need a levy for capital work.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,2,talk,George,,"@Shunichi, the complaints died because there was no one to ask.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,2,talk,Shunichi,,"@George, exactly. We need a clear owner for the rules.","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,2,talk,Mio,,"@Ryuji, three hours a month is a lot. Adding billing would be worse.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,Asuka,,The rain exposure is bad past the downpipe. Saddles stay wet.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,Ryuji,,The ward park has fourteen households waiting. Demand is high.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,George,,The sticker register shows some flats have three bikes. Daily riders want to pay.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,Shunichi,,The neighbouring block had arrears. Two households stopped coming to meetings.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Mio,,The display frame takes twenty seconds to load. It needs greasing twice a year.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,2,4,talk,Asuka,,"@Mio, twenty seconds is manageable, but the greasing is a chore.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,2,4,talk,Ryuji,,"@George, if daily riders want to pay, maybe a paid system works?","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,2,4,talk,George,,"@Ryuji, but the minutes show the old system was static and unfair.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
53,2,4,talk,Shunichi,,"@Mio, the physical effort of the frame is a concern for maintenance.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
54,2,4,talk,Mio,,"@Shunichi, I agree. We need to minimize the ongoing physical work.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
